        "collapsible_row_Bn4K3H": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tap Repairs & Replacement",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Dripping taps can waste water and money. Our plumbers can quickly repair or replace faulty taps, restoring your fixtures to full functionality. Whether it's a minor drip or a complete replacement, we ensure a seamless fix: Annoyed by the constant dripping sound? Our tap repair and replacement services will put an end to it, saving you from wasted water and inflated bills</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HJVrfn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Toilet Repairs & Replacement",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>A malfunctioning toilet can be a major inconvenience. We offer comprehensive toilet repair and replacement services to resolve issues like clogs, leaks, and poor flushing. Our plumbers can install a new, efficient model if needed. Dealing with an overflowing or non-flushing toilet? Let our experts handle the dirty work and restore your bathroom to normalcy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4TUAXj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Water Meter Repairs",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Accurate water meter readings are crucial for fair billing. Our technicians can repair or replace faulty water meters to ensure precise measurements and prevent overcharges. Suspect your water bill is too high? Our water meter repair service will ensure you only pay for what you use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ghqiH7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Washing Machine Installation",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Proper installation of your washing machine is essential for optimal performance. Our plumbers ensure correct setup and connection to prevent leaks and improve efficiency. Struggling with installation? Our professionals will handle everything, ensuring your washing machine is installed safely and correctly.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UYX3ni": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Dishwasher Installation",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Installing a dishwasher requires precise plumbing connections. Our experts will install your dishwasher, ensuring it functions perfectly and integrates seamlessly with your existing plumbing. Want to avoid installation mishaps? Trust our team to set up your dishwasher correctly, preventing leaks and operational issues.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WFRKQp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Leaking Taps & Toilets",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Persistent leaks can cause water damage and increase your bills. We specialise in locating and fixing leaks in taps and toilets, providing long-term solutions to prevent future problems. Tired of wasting water? Our leak repair services will save you money and protect your home from water damage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PHM88d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Outdoor Plumbing",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Outdoor plumbing requires specialised knowledge to handle different environmental factors. We offer services for garden taps, irrigation systems, and outdoor kitchens, ensuring reliable outdoor plumbing solutions. Need reliable outdoor plumbing? Our experts can handle all your outdoor plumbing needs, from garden taps to complex irrigation systems.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cb8Nhc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Broken Pipes",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Broken pipes can cause severe water damage. Our plumbers are equipped to quickly repair or replace broken pipes, restoring your plumbing system to normal. Dealing with water damage? Our prompt pipe repair services will minimize damage and restore your plumbing quickly.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HEhE9G": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Burst Water Pipes",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Burst pipes are a plumbing emergency that requires immediate attention. We provide rapid response to repair burst pipes, preventing extensive water damage and costly repairs. Facing a plumbing emergency? Our team is available 24/7 to repair burst pipes and protect your home.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Rktzn9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pipe Freezing",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>In colder months, pipe freezing can cause significant issues. Our preventative measures and repair services address frozen pipes, ensuring your plumbing system remains functional. Worried about frozen pipes? Our experts can prevent and repair freezing issues, safeguarding your plumbing in winter.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KyebeJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pipe Locator",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Accurately locating pipes is crucial for repairs and renovations. Our advanced pipe locator technology ensures precise detection, avoiding unnecessary damage to your property. Need to locate pipes accurately? Our technology allows us to pinpoint pipe locations, making repairs and renovations easier.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_EqnPcR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Leak Detection",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Hidden leaks can lead to significant damage over time. Our leak detection services use advanced technology to find and fix leaks before they cause major issues. Concerned about hidden leaks? Our detection services will find and fix leaks promptly, protecting your home from damage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
